==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
Old Norse ''[[ríkr]]''
===Adjective===
'''ríkur''' {{m}}, [[rík]] {{f}}, [[ríkt]] {{n}} ({{compa}} [[ríkari]], {{superl}} [[ríkastur]])

# [[rich]], [[wealthy]]
#: ''Mamma mín er '''rík'''.''
#:: My mom is '''rich'''.
# [[powerful]], [[strong]], [[compelling]]
#: Ég hef '''ríkar''' ástæður.''
#:: I have '''compelling''' reasons.

